  "name": "Basics 8 · Clocked Groove",
  "description": "An external Clock at four ticks per beat drives Groove's sixteenth-note steps. A constant run gate starts on the next pulse. Groove pitch feeds a Quantizer and VCO; its gate plucks an ADSR/VCA, with a short stereo delay. Unplug the clock to restore Groove's authored BPM.",
